  "description": "Refurbishment of the existing garage and workshop at the rear of the property with the transformation of its flat roof by a single-pitched roof, and the replacement of the garage door on Keston road by a single door.\r\rThe creation of a return extension along Keston road connecting the workshop to the main house, with a single-pitched roof.\r\rA proposed double dormer roof extension on the garden side of the house  \r\rA partial double dormer pitched-roof extension on the side towards Amott road.\r\rThe replacement of the existing windows throughout the house.\r\rThe enlargement of some of the existing openings on the garden facade and the removal of one window.\r\rThe creation of a new round opening on gable facade and the extension in height of the existing window.\r\rThe refurbishement of the existing ground floor street-side canopy and bow window roof.\r\rThe partial opening of the front garden wall for installation of bin storage area or ASHP behind a fence.",
